# Frontend PnL dashboard

- `src/` is a read-only live PnL UI (snapshot + SSE). Prefer declared deps: axios, zustand, react-query, react-router-dom, lightweight-charts, Tailwind — before adding new packages.
- Vite proxies `/demo` → `http://127.0.0.1:8010`. Production: `npm run build` then `demo_streaming` serves `frontend/dist`.
- Remote access: `DEMO_STREAM_HOST=0.0.0.0` on `:8010` + AWS SG TCP 8010. Keep ngrok on `:8000` for webhooks only.
- Main FastAPI has no CORS/WebSocket. Do not invent a browser WS client against `app.main` without a backend endpoint.
- Details: `app/docs/frontend.md`.
